                "Indication"  : "Amount: right asks for courses, tiles, flags and stones where it reaches; left keeps them off. The rest add effects to the material's own hand (Pen: Material linework) where it reaches: looser or tighter, more random or more perfect, rounder or squarer corners, rougher or cleaner edges, more broken or more closed lines, more or less of the dark and pale wash accents (0 as drawn, left less, right more). Seed draws another variation of the material where the point holds, about two thirds of the way to its ring: the dice rolls a new number, and the slider cycles 10 either side of it. Copy material data writes it all out, to make new materials from a look you like.",
